    corner + speech-bubble tail), same shape as the launcher icon and
    RustyMark.kt, so a notification is recognisably this app rather than a
    generic bell.

    Android renders a small icon as an alpha mask and tints it, so this must
    be one flat white shape. The three content lines are punched out with
    evenOdd rather than drawn in a second colour, which would disappear once
    the system flattens the icon.
-->
